### Superseded 2026-06-26 note: `services/jsnode-http-server` was briefly mislanded in ICK

This intermediate slice was corrected by the `apps/jsnode-ick` relocation above:ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;fQMkvEBu88TSTHoxfhMy8wxPSpJpuSpHH4i6bXSRrk4ƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;0qzW1uW4bcLZnXXpCt_JwpUUh9I0qYpI1XUzhO5uU5Aƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkc301ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;VCdXvvvoKdpTDE-koeUUdhdIaIJcSpVRc5RZfuw48NIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;vVnrHO6xygTffp_h6Y5FZRWh_Je7bUPh-8PVCiWhwC8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkkhttp-serverƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;qxLfC2a5PGA6BU_iDRzpuG7IfxbpGTiMDfO_1MAIRJAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkyXThis intermediate slice was corrected by the `apps/jsnode-ick` relocation above:

- moved the package-bin HTTP/MCP transport implementation from `services/jsnode-http-server/src/index.mts` and `services/jsnode-http-server/src/serve-node-binary.mts` to `apps/jsnode-ick/src/package-bin-transport.mts` and `apps/jsnode-ick/src/package-bin-transport-runtime.mts`;
- renamed the public API to JSNode ICK app ownership: `projectJsnodeIckPackageBinTransports`, `serveJsnodeIckPackageBinTransports`, `serveJsnodeIckPackageBinTransportProcesses`, and related transport/process types;
