  ("precondition" "A sovereign customer addresses one exact digest-bound ActivityStreams solicitation to the Platform Node Inducer, names the admitted territory and offering, supplies bounded resource ceilings, rejects foreign writes, and later accepts only the provider-authored offer with a single-use expiring capability attenuated to the same RMN law and demand.")
  ("operation" "The provider assays only its local readiness fixture, checks exact offer, capability, formation-receipt, account, and law bindings, appends every offer, refusal, operation, result, and customer decision through the contracted RWIL/RDF provider, and returns a proposal-only readiness result without executing inside customer territory.")
  ("postcondition" "The customer receives a content-addressed readiness result or typed refusal under this exact law; all durable provider evidence belongs to the provider's own RWIL history; the customer alone decides usefulness and admission; no customer mutation, foreign mutation, production activation, external settlement, credential use, or continuing provider runtime authority occurs.")ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;YjBgPyKNmrK1-I3OIr7-zt_ZlYltJxRCRPzLTcBrbj0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkgcurrentƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ycXbyL74UJpO2tV7Id074W0a4O25_xwTcYE78NseMNMƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;7cOYW1UVM_Lh69qvqdFSGT4YofRDb8w4_wf8pW7bn8Uƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkd3930ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;o1ula6eaeUPh1pt5qZ2CXnsuQunhw2-uYL8C0yA06vcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;u0RooaHV1vvfDSc1X_3oO5QLlWigR0_fwUIwVKh6-sMƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;gkgmJVo7yMnFj-k4zQO_OXQiPl-sKzs4I114399THvAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;BWdSyaMpYLHSYFYugihSIA5_x1mRTUp-sx-qwrxHvgkƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;8HLXBwKjI2YYxJFcyI8mbc-elC90B5bJB862EaStBmcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkmplatform nodeƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;VxiIGbuugF_yLHwG2oRXNRho3R-51PHfOY1UQ3-QOaUƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumduni