  ("precondition" "Production is explicitly enabled by content-valid structured Board and Leader decisions which each bind one exact internal allocation, customer, child node and target, admitted RSC Quiescent receiver actor, parent and contract, customer contract, ceilings, an internal-allocation/no-external-settlement consideration admission, and a publication-refused admission. A content-valid, separately digest-pinned PNI-owned configuration admission attests the exact evidence identifiers, evidence digest, binding, named authoritative sources, and local provenance at the PNI configuration boundary; it explicitly does not claim cryptographic signature verification. The allocation admits exactly one induction. The normalized digest-complete manifest is bounded to sixteen files, 524288 bytes, and 120 seconds. One single-use customer capability binds the exact offer, effects, authorization evidence and admission, target, manifest, offer time, and an expiry no later than the offer-bound maximum.")
  ("operation" "The Platform Node Inducer validates semantic content identities and exact structures, claims and submits one deterministic idempotency key in append-only claimed/submitted states, and requests or recovers the create-only admission only through an injected receiver-owned admit/status ingress. Same-process calls share one in-flight promise. New effects require current admitted authorization and a strictly unexpired capability. An exact already-submitted claim is recognized by its stored offer and capability digests before new-effect gates and may perform status-only recovery and finalization after expiry; that recovery path cannot call admit. Every status call supplies both the idempotency kƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;UdraW_fzsuRfZvuqvzs4LtVbjRUtigh7s0Wm5f2MlNkƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkgcurrentƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;cKNsYAz6oWQY2_sssNPGYLuff3udNl-kFrBtN9VVLlcƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;1D73-p_NcEwWkNzG0RjzctaktEox8jQuyH9GJPJwPhcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkc676ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;GwmFVLTu6rW3NFIs6iAqXVn5k1fxvXGeG5fBJ4H8Stsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;8kJ4RBoFmndAzmnSXKO1lAAKthq9KdGYYDSLRVIPnX8ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;tLMgxsW1U5CwwNxKtbrxBAV0vecDU7QWQooI-o5MBf0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;fLVTGxryKPmn0j_O2VVXpLDhJ7PcuUs_NAt5cKCJ78Eƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ZrzGWZzbOLJdg3qk2M